WEBVTT

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:06.870
My name is Taiki Kudou.

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:08.970
I wound up in the Digital World,

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:11.120
where I met Shoutmon 
and the other Digimon.

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:20.160
<b>Team Bagra</b>

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:20.160
<b>Enemy?                              The battle begins!                              Enemy</b>

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:20.160
<b>Team ?                       Team Taiki                    Team Kiriha</b>

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:20.160
Mysterious
Girl

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:20.160
<b>Enemy?                                    Enemy?

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:20.160
Rival

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:20.160
Protagonist

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:14.630
This world is having a lot of trouble

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:17.410
with the attacking Bagra Army.

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:20.160
In the Magma Zone,

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.580
the Bagra Army has 
been capturing Digimon

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:26.230
and forcing them to search for the 
Code Crown, the symbol of this zone.

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:30.660
We defeated DeathMeramon with

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:33.130
Shoutmon X3, freeing everyone,

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:35.380
but then, AncientVolcamon showed up!

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:44.990
<b>The Brave General Tactimon Approaches!</b>

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:41.040
The Brave General Tactimon Approaches!

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:53.870
Who dares to anger me?!

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:57.800
Taiki! We've gotta DigiXros 
again to defeat him!

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:01.340
Shoutmon!

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:05.840
Defeat me, you say? What nerve!

00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:09.110
Big Bang Fire!

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.220
Did you see that?

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:23.750
Any more of that, and this 
whole cave will collapse!

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:27.450
If that happens, all the 
prisoners will be wiped out!

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:28.930
What do we do, Taiki?

00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:32.070
Ballistamon, I need to talk to you.

00:01:33.140 --> 00:01:33.930
What is it?

00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:36.370
What are you doing?! 
This is an emergency!

00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:40.510
What's wrong? Come on and fight!

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:43.150
AncientVolcamon...

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:46.080
We surrender.

00:01:46.550 --> 00:01:47.650
What?!

00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:49.490
What are you saying?!

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:51.670
Who's surrendering?!

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:53.120
Please...

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:55.390
Listen to Taiki!

00:01:55.730 --> 00:02:01.130
If you truly surrender, 
then give me your red Xros Loader.

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:05.640
What is that?

00:02:08.180 --> 00:02:09.430
<i>I get it!</i>

00:02:09.430 --> 00:02:13.750
<i>AncientVolcamon has never 
seen a Xros Loader before!</i>

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:16.040
So he won't realize it's a fake.

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:18.450
Taiki has a plan.

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:23.170
If you give him that, we can't DigiXros!

00:02:23.170 --> 00:02:26.060
Of course, Brother hasn't noticed...

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:29.090
Lord AncientVolcamon.

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:31.610
Now we can't DigiXros.

00:02:31.610 --> 00:02:33.530
Are you still afraid of us?

00:02:33.530 --> 00:02:38.940
You mouthy little brat!

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:40.430
Yukidarumon!

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:42.870
Calm Lord AncientVolcamon's rage!

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:54.350
Perhaps I'll chill out and 
approach this more calmly.

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:59.860
All right, lock them up and 
then report to Lord Tactimon.

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:00.850
Yes, sir!

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:02.890
Take them all into custody.

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:10.100
Still...

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:12.740
I misjudged you, General!

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:17.640
Why did you give him the Xros Loader?!

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:18.840
It was a fake.

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:20.480
A-A fake?!

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:21.710
H-Hey! Idiot!

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:25.470
If we had kept fighting,

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:28.120
the cave would've collapsed 
and killed everyone.

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:30.940
Plus, if we let them imprison us,

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:32.690
we'll find out where the prison is.

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:34.270
I see.

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:37.640
Cutemon's parents might be there, too.

00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:39.090
Clever.

00:03:40.710 --> 00:03:44.170
Just as I'd expect from the 
guy I call my General!

00:03:44.170 --> 00:03:45.810
Ow!

00:03:45.810 --> 00:03:48.310
No talking. Just keep moving.

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:50.310
Jerk!

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:54.510
I'll get to see my parents soon.

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:57.680
<i>He gave it that much thought?</i>

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:02.540
No dawdling!

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:04.760
Get in there!

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:10.700
Hey, that hurt!

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:15.930
Don't get any dumb ideas 
about escaping, got it?

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:20.930
Not that you could, anyway.

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:27.940
I can tackle through 
these iron bars in no...

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:29.150
I wouldn't do that!

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:37.370
There's electricity running 
through the iron bars?

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.990
Then I'll just use a long-range weapon!

00:04:39.990 --> 00:04:42.290
I wouldn't do that, either...

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:45.970
Shut up! Soul Crusher!

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:51.010
Shoutmon, are you okay?

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:53.670
I must look so lame...

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:56.420
Yep. Lame.

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:57.690
Excuse me...

00:04:58.680 --> 00:05:00.610
I heard from Bearmon

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:03.720
that my parents are being 
forced to work here.

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:07.630
If you mean Mr. and Mrs. 
Cutemon, they were here.

00:05:07.630 --> 00:05:11.220
But they were sent somewhere 
else yesterday.

00:05:13.970 --> 00:05:16.030
Where were they sent to?

00:05:16.280 --> 00:05:18.300
I don't know.

00:05:22.220 --> 00:05:24.940
Cheer up, Cutemon!

00:05:26.850 --> 00:05:29.310
Your parents are alive.

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:32.380
Isn't it enough just to know that?

00:05:34.260 --> 00:05:35.410
Yeah!

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:41.250
Dorulumon, you really are a nice guy.

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:53.160
This Zone now belongs to my army.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:54.410
Lord Tactimon...

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:56.630
A report from the Magma Zone tells us

00:05:56.630 --> 00:05:58.450
the boy with the red Xros 
Loader and his friends

00:05:58.450 --> 00:05:59.620
have been captured.

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:01.490
Execute them immediately.

00:06:01.490 --> 00:06:02.510
Yes, sir.

00:06:02.510 --> 00:06:03.960
And one more thing...

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:06.940
It seems Dorulumon was captured 
along with the children.

00:06:06.940 --> 00:06:08.050
What?

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:10.840
Then I will go, too.

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:12.880
Hold off on the execution until then.

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:13.920
Yes, sir.

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:19.320
A visitor? When did you show up?

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:23.190
Shall I assist with that execution?

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:27.300
A mercenary like you should 
watch his attitude.

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:29.420
I should warn you.

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:30.600
On the battlefield...

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:34.440
one may find himself stabbed 
in the back by his own ally.

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:37.740
I advise utmost caution.

00:06:40.890 --> 00:06:42.780
Maggot.

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:44.740
Everyone listen.

00:06:44.740 --> 00:06:46.650
We've come to help you.

00:06:47.230 --> 00:06:50.090
Let's all work together 
to get out of here!

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:51.790
But how?

00:06:52.170 --> 00:06:53.810
Listen and be amazed!

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:56.710
I'm sure our General 
has an awesome plan!

00:06:56.710 --> 00:06:58.700
And I'm gonna come up with it right now!

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:03.300
You haven't even thought of one?!

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:06.080
I'm not sure escaping is a good idea.

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:08.860
It has been attempted many times...

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:10.430
But those who try always get caught

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:12.930
and treated even worse than before.

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:15.510
So this is a place where 
losers end up, huh?

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:17.530
<i>Dorulumon...</i>

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:21.010
Still, I can't turn my back on them!

00:07:21.010 --> 00:07:24.420
If we're trapped, we'll just have 
to cut ourselves an air hole!

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:26.820
An air hole?

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:29.300
Hey, you have your Xros Loader.

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:32.900
Can't you just use Shoutmon 
X4 to smash up the prison?

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:36.070
If we do that, the whole 
cave will collapse.

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:39.040
And below us is magma. 
There's no way out.

00:07:40.590 --> 00:07:42.870
To sneak everyone out of here quietly...

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:43.880
Don't tell me...

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:45.010
Yes!

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:46.520
We dig!

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:48.970
Ow!

00:07:48.970 --> 00:07:52.160
You should've expected that. 
These walls are rock hard.

00:07:52.160 --> 00:07:54.430
But it's our only choice!

00:07:54.430 --> 00:07:55.590
Taiki!

00:07:55.940 --> 00:07:59.400
If that's our General's decision, I'm in!

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:00.290
Me, too!

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:03.220
Okay, then, Taiki, give me my sword.

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:06.460
Just so you know, it's not your sword!

00:08:06.990 --> 00:08:09.730
You'll help me, too, Zenjirou?

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:11.030
Starmon!

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:12.570
Pickmons!

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:14.010
DigiXros!

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:17.980
Dig here, woof woof!

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:22.010
Rare Star Sword!

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:35.700
Oh, what the hey? 
I guess I'll join them.

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:37.560
I'll help, too!

00:08:37.560 --> 00:08:40.320
We tried digging before,

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:42.570
but we couldn't finish by dawn.

00:08:42.570 --> 00:08:45.210
Those guys will come around 
again in the morning.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:46.940
It won't be pretty...

00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:50.480
Then we'll be thrown away, 
like my friend was.

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:53.610
Listen up!

00:08:53.610 --> 00:08:58.420
As long as I'm here, 
I won't let that happen again!

00:08:58.420 --> 00:08:59.520
That's right!

00:08:59.520 --> 00:09:01.450
That's exactly why...

00:09:02.260 --> 00:09:04.920
we're working to build a new world!

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:25.240
A new world...

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:28.950
I know I don't wanna be 
kept working here forever!

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:31.850
Only despair awaits us!

00:09:31.850 --> 00:09:33.530
You're right!

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:34.830
In that case...

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:36.480
We should at least try!

00:09:36.480 --> 00:09:37.290
Yeah!

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:41.560
Everyone...

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:47.210
In that case, 
let's bet it all on these guys!

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:49.100
You'll all help, right?

00:09:51.970 --> 00:09:53.320
Everyone...

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:54.450
Thank you!

00:09:58.460 --> 00:09:59.880
Looking good, guys!

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:02.560
Even if we get out of the prison,

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:04.850
do you think you can 
beat AncientVolcamon?

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:07.130
That doesn't matter.

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:12.400
All that matters right now 
is saving the prisoners.

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:14.960
Okay, I'll take over here!

00:10:23.530 --> 00:10:24.710
Out of the way!

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:27.810
We'll never get out by 
morning at this rate!

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:32.940
<i>Dorulumon...</i>

00:10:33.680 --> 00:10:36.980
The monsters born in the 
Digital realm: Digimon.

00:10:37.460 --> 00:10:39.720
They may be made up of data,

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:44.110
but they're our precious friends 
who cry, laugh, and fight for us.

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:50.260
Join us in our world of adventure 
as we gather lots more teammates!

00:10:50.260 --> 00:10:51.330
DigiXros!

00:12:22.990 --> 00:12:24.290
You called?

00:12:24.290 --> 00:12:25.980
DeathMeramon...

00:12:25.980 --> 00:12:27.120
How're you doing?

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:28.270
No need to worry.

00:12:28.270 --> 00:12:32.120
Lord Tactimon has decided 
to attend the execution.

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:34.270
Examine this before he arrives.

00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:35.920
What is it?

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:39.740
It's the Xros Loader 
that kid was carrying.

00:12:40.180 --> 00:12:41.270
This is...

00:12:46.770 --> 00:12:49.010
Th-This is a fake!

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:52.620
What?!

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:57.030
Not bad, Dorulumon!

00:12:57.720 --> 00:12:59.220
Wh-What's that?!

00:12:59.220 --> 00:13:02.250
You think it's that "Boom, Bang" guy?!

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:05.600
Maybe he found out the 
Xros Loader was a fake!

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:07.170
Let's get out of here, quick!

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:12.240
They were waiting for us?!

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:14.070
You guys run!

00:13:14.070 --> 00:13:14.960
Okay!

00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:19.810
We'll hold them off!

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:21.050
Shoutmon!

00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:22.180
Ballistamon!

00:13:22.180 --> 00:13:23.550
DigiXros!

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:27.420
DigiXros!

00:13:35.430 --> 00:13:37.940
Shoutmon X2!

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:41.330
Let's go, boys!

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:43.370
Yes! Join us!

00:13:43.370 --> 00:13:44.520
Starmon!

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:46.200
Pickmons!

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:47.640
DigiXros!

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:49.740
Starmon!

00:13:50.670 --> 00:13:52.980
Pickmons!

00:13:56.880 --> 00:13:58.800
Sparkle!

00:14:03.220 --> 00:14:05.390
Star Axe!

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:08.480
The battle is on!

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:11.930
I'll leave the rest to you!

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:17.420
Burning Fist!

00:14:26.700 --> 00:14:28.580
Attack all at once!

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:43.030
Heat Chain!

00:14:47.670 --> 00:14:50.380
Heavy Metal Fire!

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:57.510
Now you can't escape.

00:14:57.510 --> 00:14:58.940
Heavy Metal...

00:15:05.350 --> 00:15:08.020
Buddy Blaster!

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:12.020
All right!

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:18.500
Oh, no!

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:21.500
Atomic Bomber!

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:25.700
Are you okay?!

00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:27.940
He's...

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:33.410
You will all pay!

00:15:34.730 --> 00:15:37.450
Taiki, X2 us one more time!

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:39.940
No, doing the same thing 
again won't work.

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:42.920
Dorulumon! Please help us!

00:15:46.360 --> 00:15:47.590
Shoutmon!

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:48.630
Ballistamon!

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:49.660
Dorulumon!

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:54.580
DigiXros!

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:01.960
Shoutmon!

00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:06.110
Ballistamon!

00:16:07.910 --> 00:16:09.570
Dorulumon!

00:16:17.090 --> 00:16:18.790
DigiXros!

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:45.680
Shoutmon X3!

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:48.170
Starmon!

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:49.950
Pickmons!

00:16:49.950 --> 00:16:51.390
DigiXros!

00:16:51.960 --> 00:16:53.220
Starmon!

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:56.760
Pickmons!

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:06.010
Shoutmon X4!

00:17:18.920 --> 00:17:20.350
Here I go!

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:22.650
Atomic Bomber!

00:17:22.650 --> 00:17:23.960
Defend with the Star Sword!

00:17:35.470 --> 00:17:37.400
Our turn to counterattack!

00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:40.040
Three Victorize!

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:41.410
What audacity!

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:45.040
Big Bang Fire!

00:17:47.110 --> 00:17:49.250
One more time!

00:17:54.870 --> 00:17:56.090
I can't move...

00:17:56.090 --> 00:17:57.840
Shoutmon X4!

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:02.290
This isn't good!

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:04.300
If we don't do something, he's finished!

00:18:05.190 --> 00:18:07.000
This calls for a DigiMemory.

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:08.750
<b>Agumon</b>

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:08.750
<b>Attack:</b>

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:08.750
<b>Triple Baby Flame</b>

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:10.020
Agumon!

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:15.770
Triple Baby Flame, activate!

00:18:23.970 --> 00:18:25.340
What is that?!

00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:31.640
Taiki! How can we beat him?

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:34.230
Facing him head-on won't work.

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:37.160
We have to stop his offensive energy.

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:40.110
Plug the volcano, Shoutmon X4!

00:18:48.240 --> 00:18:50.570
Impudent brats!

00:18:50.570 --> 00:18:52.370
What?!

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:55.210
Go!

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:58.780
Big Bang Fi—

00:19:02.560 --> 00:19:05.520
My magma is reversing its flow!

00:19:05.520 --> 00:19:07.630
It hurts!

00:19:11.640 --> 00:19:13.900
Burn, Xros Heart!

00:19:14.240 --> 00:19:18.470
My General's fiery heart is reaching me!

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:22.800
Three Victorize Max Power!

00:19:27.010 --> 00:19:28.230
All right!

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:30.280
That was awesome, guys!

00:19:32.840 --> 00:19:36.150
You gave me greater power than 
I ever had before, General!

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:37.590
Me, too!

00:19:37.590 --> 00:19:39.090
Yay!

00:19:39.090 --> 00:19:41.710
Same for you too, right, Dorulumon?

00:19:41.710 --> 00:19:42.940
Maybe.

00:19:42.940 --> 00:19:45.260
He's still playing the tough guy!

00:19:46.230 --> 00:19:47.570
Dorulumon!

00:19:48.860 --> 00:19:50.340
You're not hurt?

00:19:50.340 --> 00:19:51.040
Nope!

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:53.030
He always plays tough,

00:19:53.030 --> 00:19:56.070
but Dorulumon sure is a 
guy we can depend on.

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:57.920
He saved everyone.

00:19:57.920 --> 00:20:01.650
Now peace will return 
to the Magma Zone, huh?

00:20:01.650 --> 00:20:02.350
Yeah.

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:07.260
The sun is rising on our victory.

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:09.850
Someone's coming!

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:11.020
That's...

00:20:18.870 --> 00:20:20.460
Wh-Who is that?!

00:20:20.460 --> 00:20:22.030
I think it's...

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:25.870
He's one of the Three Head Officers 
of the new Bagra Empire.

00:20:26.570 --> 00:20:29.230
His name is Tactimon.

00:20:29.850 --> 00:20:31.760
So you managed to escape,

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:34.080
boy with the red Xros Loader.

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:37.450
Was it you who saved them, Dorulumon?

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:39.750
You know Dorulumon?

00:20:39.750 --> 00:20:41.990
Let me tell you something interesting.

00:20:42.500 --> 00:20:47.660
Dorulumon once overthrew many 
Zones as my right hand man.

00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:49.530
Dorulumon did that?

00:20:49.530 --> 00:20:50.530
What?!

00:20:53.710 --> 00:20:54.980
Dorulumon...

