00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:13.420
Are you ready for the switch to digital?!

00:21:13.420 --> 00:21:14.500
No...

00:21:15.770 --> 00:21:18.420
Dorulumon used to be a 
soldier in the Bagra Army?!

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:20.530
